,{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Beer Bar, Food, Nightlife","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","review_id":"yxplYP3NkHWRfsi-Q5Ibxw","date":"2014-07-29T18:51:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9387855529785156,"text_excerpt":"Don't judge a bar by its name. Okay, this one you can... We were in New Orleans for just a few days, and I saw many people walking around with their Huge Ass Beers. I figured it was the typical crowded sleazy bar that you find on Bourbon Street. But I was wrong. We stopped by on a Sunday evening, and it was actually pretty nice. There was a jazz band playing in the back and plenty of seating at the bar for our large group. We stayed for a couple hours. I got the Angry Orchard that was on tap in the Huge Ass Beer size. I had to share it -- it really is huge. :) The bar entrance is fully open to the street, so it's nice to have your beer and watch people having a good time on the street."},{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","review_id":"Bh7EIA885GA5isCDg-PU7A","date":"2017-11-02T18:20:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9263177514076233,"text_excerpt":"As far as bars on Bourbon Street go, this one wasn't too bad. The place is actually called \"Prohibition: Huge Ass Beers\", so make a note of that if you're looking for the place, for some reason. Just like any bar like this, it's going to be a tourist trap and there were plenty on the night we were here. We were hanging out waiting for the Krewe of Boo parade to start and we decided to sit at the bar, have a few drinks and watch the LSU game. There was a band playing that was pretty good and the staff was friendly and fast. They have a \"2 for 1\" deal that basically applies to all of the crappy beer, so I skipped it and got myself a regular priced Lagunitas IPA that I was happy with. I woul..."},{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","review_id":"VSgIpMyZKpGxgFTll95Anw","date":"2013-04-08T22:09:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9072599411010742,"text_excerpt":"They are a tourist destination on Bourbon Street, with a guy holding a big sign that simply says \"Huge Ass Beers.\" This is where you get sucked in, because the guy lets you hold the big ass sign to take photos and then you go inside. They have huge ass beers and huge ass burgers too! They start with standard beer for $3 and all the way up to 40oz for $12, which is pretty damn good! It's a good spot for comfort food and huge ass beers..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","photo_id":"my0RbO13hWmkde9CdHK97A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/my0RbO13hWmkde9CdHK97A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.871364951133728},{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","photo_id":"rwlEKw4-GTTtIIptk08wyA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rwlEKw4-GTTtIIptk08wyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8338056802749634},{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","photo_id":"jrkP6LJbM7Fcf_MW8ANlJA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/jrkP6LJbM7Fcf_MW8ANlJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7972128391265869},{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","photo_id":"tvvz8xLwohRNGnCPyTj7tQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/tvvz8xLwohRNGnCPyTj7tQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7958036661148071},{"business_id":"P95yU9WHc5fdsMl3q_D6BQ","photo_id":"8KWwvTSdSelXwl2mAnHmeg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8KWwvTSdSelXwl2mAnHmeg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7733665704727173}]},"notebook_case":null}
